@startuml
title Boomaga-IPP — Print/Preview/Submit Sequence (conforms to code @ e77d08c)
actor "Printer User" as User
participant "Host CUPS" as CUPS
participant "IppServer\n(boomaga-ipp-backend)" as IPP
participant "JobProcessor / JobQueue" as BACKEND
participant "NotificationServer\n+ boomaga-ipc" as IPC
participant "Xilem GUI / AppData\n(boomaga-preview)" as GUI
participant "Renderer worker\n(poppler + cairo)" as REN
participant "NUpCalculator\n(boomaga-layout-engine)" as LAY
participant "Print worker\n(lpstat/lpoptions/lp)" as PRINT
participant "Downstream CUPS printer" as TARGET

== Capture and notify (partial IPP service; notification path realized) ==
User -> CUPS : print document
CUPS -> IPP  : TCP / IPP request
note right of IPP
  Listener and job scaffolding exist.
  Complete IPP parsing/response generation
  and captured-document handoff remain open.
end note
IPP -> BACKEND : add_job(PrintJobRequest)
BACKEND -> BACKEND : queue and process
BACKEND -> IPC : protocol-v1 lifecycle Message
IPC -> GUI : Unix-socket status notification
GUI -> GUI : deduplicate/update job status

== Open and preview PDF (realized) ==
User -> GUI : choose PDF or pass CLI path
GUI -> REN : LoadDocument(path, generation)
REN --> GUI : DocumentLoaded(metadata)
GUI -> REN : RenderPage(page, generation)
REN --> GUI : PageRendered(CanvasImage)
GUI -> LAY : calculate selected 1/2/4/6/8-up sheet
LAY --> GUI : page positions / sheet orientation
GUI -> GUI : cache and display imposed sheet
User -> GUI : click canvas, then arrows/N/P/Space/+/-/0
GUI -> GUI : navigate or update zoom

